    "title": "Which One is Kind, Dada? The Sacred Jaher Grove of Dumka",
    "slug": "budhan-murmu-dumka-santhal-sacred-grove",
    "topic": "Santhal Botanical Wisdom & Sacred Jaher Groves",
    "decade": "1970s",
    "start": 1970,
